{"baseRefName":"main","body":"## Summary\\n\\n- Adds a retained 2026-09-08 Nubia P0110 no-Host Android UI/UX rerun evidence package from current main.\\n- Documents the Gradle/UTP instrumentation wrapper crash as diagnostic only, while retaining the direct per-class am instrument 86/86 pass and focused JVM 188/188 pass.\\n- Records no-Host boundaries: no Host/GUI/TCC work, no created ADB reverse mapping, and no local tcp:54321 listener rows.\\n\\n## Verification\\n\\n- shasum -a 256 -c SHA256SUMS from the evidence directory\\n- python3 -m unittest tests.phase3.test_repository_privacy.RepositoryPrivacyTests.test_current_tree_has_no_raw_android_serial_contexts tests.phase3.test_repository_privacy.RepositoryPrivacyTests.test_current_tree_has_no_device_endpoint tests.phase3.test_repository_privacy.RepositoryPrivacyTests.test_delivery_document_links_resolve -v\\n- git diff --check\\n\\nThis remains no-Host UI/UX evidence only and does not close Host-backed product E2E gates.","closedAt":"2026-09-08T01:05:27Z","files":[{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-08-nubia-p0110-no-host-uiux-current-main-rerun/README.md","additions":144,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-08-nubia-p0110-no-host-uiux-current-main-rerun/SHA256SUMS","additions":54,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-08-nubia-p0110-no-host-uiux-current-main-rerun/logs/adb-devices.txt","additions":3,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-08-nubia-p0110-no-host-uiux-current-main-rerun/logs/adb-reverse-after-tests.txt","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-08-nubia-p0110-no-host-uiux-current-main-rerun/logs/connected-uiux-instrumentation.log","additions":134,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"do